Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:01:42.82,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}▍{\r\fn得意黑}2026 辛辛那提 WTA1000 第三轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:01:42.82,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}萨巴伦卡 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs44}6-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs44}1 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs44}6-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs44}3{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 王欣瑜 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:05.64,EN,,0,0,0,,to 61 63 comfortable and dominant.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:05.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,六比一 六比三 轻松又强势
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.64,0:00:07.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Arena Sabalanka sailing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.64,0:00:07.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,萨巴伦卡一路
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.24,0:00:10.44,EN,,0,0,0,,through to the fourth round in Cincinnati.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.24,0:00:10.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,闯进辛辛那提第四轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.44,0:00:11.80,EN,,0,0,0,,She has an incredible record
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.44,0:00:11.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,她在这里的战绩
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.80,0:00:12.52,EN,,0,0,0,,at this tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.80,0:00:12.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,相当惊人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.52,0:00:15.96,EN,,0,0,0,,She is a former champion
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.52,0:00:15.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,她是这里的前冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.96,0:00:19.72,EN,,0,0,0,,and that was a comfortable night's work
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.96,0:00:19.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,今晚的胜利很轻松
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.72,0:00:20.92,EN,,0,0,0,,for the world number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.72,0:00:20.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,对这位世界第一来说
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.92,0:00:24.12,EN,,0,0,0,,61 63 Look at the smile on your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.92,0:00:24.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,看看你脸上这笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.12,0:00:24.84,EN,,0,0,0,,You must be pleased
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.12,0:00:24.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,你一定很满意
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.84,0:00:25.96,EN,,0,0,0,,with your performance tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.84,0:00:25.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,今晚的表现吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.96,0:00:27.40,EN,,0,0,0,,Especially you played her a few years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.96,0:00:27.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,尤其是你几年前跟她打过
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.40,0:00:28.68,EN,,0,0,0,,It was a tough three setter,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.40,0:00:28.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,那次打了艰难的三盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.68,0:00:30.52,EN,,0,0,0,,but tonight very different.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.68,0:00:30.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,今晚完全不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.52,0:00:31.88,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah, I cannot complain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.52,0:00:31.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,是啊 没什么好抱怨的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.88,0:00:34.28,EN,,0,0,0,,She's a tough opponent and to get this win
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.88,0:00:34.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,她是个难缠的对手 能拿下这场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.28,0:00:37.72,EN,,0,0,0,,in straight sets and under like what,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.28,0:00:37.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且直落两盘 用时还不到
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.72,0:00:40.20,EN,,0,0,0,,an hour, it's it's insane result.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.72,0:00:40.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,一个小时 这个结果太疯狂了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.20,0:00:42.04,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm super happy to be through.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.20,0:00:42.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,能晋级我特别开心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.04,0:00:42.84,EN,,0,0,0,,What do you think made you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.04,0:00:42.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,你觉得是什么让你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.84,0:00:43.88,EN,,0,0,0,,so dangerous tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.84,0:00:43.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,今晚这么难对付？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.88,0:00:45.32,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, you were hitting the ball deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.88,0:00:45.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,我是说 你把球打得很深
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.32,0:00:47.32,EN,,0,0,0,,You never let her get into a rhythm at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.32,0:00:47.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,完全没让她找到节奏
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.32,0:00:49.64,EN,,0,0,0,,What are you most pleased with?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.32,0:00:49.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,你对哪一点最满意？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.64,0:00:51.72,EN,,0,0,0,,I don't know. I think I really trusted myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.64,0:00:51.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,不知道 我很相信自己
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.72,0:00:53.08,EN,,0,0,0,,I was just going for my shots
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.72,0:00:53.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,我就是放手去打
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.08,0:00:54.36,EN,,0,0,0,,without like overthinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.08,0:00:54.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,没有想太多
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.36,0:00:58.04,EN,,0,0,0,,And I think that was the the the weapon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.36,0:00:58.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得那就是今晚
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.04,0:00:58.92,EN,,0,0,0,,of tonight match.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.04,0:00:58.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,这场球的武器
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.92,0:01:00.60,EN,,0,0,0,,And I'm super happy I was able
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.92,0:01:00.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,我也很高兴自己能
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.60,0:01:02.92,EN,,0,0,0,,to stay focused and to be, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.60,0:01:02.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,保持专注 就是那种
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.92,0:01:04.28,EN,,0,0,0,,in every point.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.92,0:01:04.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,每一分都在状态里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.28,0:01:06.12,EN,,0,0,0,,That's 45 consecutive wins
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.28,0:01:06.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,这是连续四十五场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.12,0:01:07.32,EN,,0,0,0,,at 1,00 tournaments.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.12,0:01:07.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,在一千分赛的胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.32,0:01:08.92,EN,,0,0,0,,You're the leader of active players
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.32,0:01:08.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,你是现役球员里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.92,0:01:09.96,EN,,0,0,0,,on the WTA.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.92,0:01:09.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,排在第一位的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.96,0:01:12.04,EN,,0,0,0,,That says a lot about what you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.96,0:01:12.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,这说明了很多
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.04,0:01:14.04,EN,,0,0,0,,do to your game when you're at a 1000,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.04,0:01:14.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,打一千分赛时你的状态
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.04,0:01:15.40,EN,,0,0,0,,when you're at a major.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.04,0:01:15.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,打大满贯时也是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.40,0:01:16.92,EN,,0,0,0,,What is it about these events?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.40,0:01:16.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,这些赛事有什么特别？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.92,0:01:18.36,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm wondering if it has anything
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.92,0:01:18.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,我在想这是不是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.36,0:01:20.92,EN,,0,0,0,,to do with the fans here in Mason, Ohio.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.36,0:01:20.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,和梅森这里的球迷有关
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.92,0:01:23.40,EN,,0,0,0,,But
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.92,0:01:23.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,不过
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.40,0:01:26.12,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, of course, guys, I'm super happy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.40,0:01:26.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,我是说 当然 各位 我特别开心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.12,0:01:28.28,EN,,0,0,0,,to be back and to play in front of you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.12,0:01:28.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,能回来在你们面前打球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.28,0:01:30.84,EN,,0,0,0,,It's it's always super enjoyable.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.28,0:01:30.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,一直都特别享受
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.84,0:01:31.72,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.84,0:01:31.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.72,0:01:33.72,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you for supporting you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.72,0:01:33.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们一直支持
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.72,0:01:36.20,EN,,0,0,0,,Make this place very very special.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.72,0:01:36.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,让这里变得特别不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.20,0:01:37.08,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.20,0:01:37.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.08,0:01:39.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Okay, your 2024 champion everybody
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.08,0:01:39.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,好的 各位 你们的 2024 年冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.24,0:01:40.92,EN,,0,0,0,,is through to the round of 16.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.24,0:01:40.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,已经晋级第四轮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.92,0:01:42.82,EN,,0,0,0,,Arena Sabalena.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.92,0:01:42.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,萨巴伦卡
